# Shared postfix transport map: domains that chatmail relays cannot deliver to.
#
# Format: one "<domain> discard:" per line, full-line comments only
# (postfix does not support comments after an entry).
# Put a "# YYYY-MM-DD reason" line above new entries.
# A domain that answers again but should stay listed gets a
# "# keep: <domain> <reason>" line: the daily check then does not report it.
# Only "discard:" is accepted; sync-discard-list.sh rejects any other action.
#
# discard: drops the message silently instead of keeping it in the queue for
# days. error: (bounce) was tested earlier and broke sending on our relays,
# so the list uses discard: only.

